From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lpgauthier <lpgauthier@circworld.qc.ca>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:50:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 18/22] Ignore query strings that look like php-cgi switches
 (CVE-2012-1823, CVE-2012-2311)

When php-cgi runs as a plain CGI (e.g. Apache mod_cgi/Action), a query
string without '=' is passed as command-line arguments, so
"?-s" or "?-d+allow_url_include=1" could disclose source or run code.
Command-line parsing is skipped when QUERY_STRING has no '=' and its
URL-decoded form starts (after leading whitespace) with '-'.

Source: Ubuntu hardy php5-CVE-2012-1823.patch, with the check replaced
by the final upstream form (PHP 5.3.13/5.4.3), which also covers
encoded '=' (CVE-2012-2311) and leading whitespace.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 sapi/cgi/cgi_main.c | 20 +++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sapi/cgi/cgi_main.c b/sapi/cgi/cgi_main.c
index ff5b8f3051..9e92292ff2 100644
--- a/sapi/cgi/cgi_main.c
+++ b/sapi/cgi/cgi_main.c
@@ -62,6 +62,7 @@
 #include "php_main.h"
 #include "fopen_wrappers.h"
 #include "ext/standard/php_standard.h"
+#include "ext/standard/url.h"
 #ifdef PHP_WIN32
 #include <io.h>
 #include <fcntl.h>
@@ -1355,6 +1356,9 @@ int main(int argc, char *argv[])
 	int status = 0;
 #endif
 #endif /* PHP_FASTCGI */
+	char *query_string;
+	char *decoded_query_string;
+	int skip_getopt = 0;
 
 #if 0 && defined(PHP_DEBUG)
 	/* IIS is always making things more difficult.  This allows
@@ -1409,7 +1413,21 @@ int main(int argc, char *argv[])
 	}
 #endif
 
-	while ((c = php_getopt(argc, argv, OPTIONS, &php_optarg, &php_optind, 0)) != -1) {
+	if ((query_string = getenv("QUERY_STRING")) != NULL && strchr(query_string, '=') == NULL) {
+		/* we've got query string that has no = - apache CGI will pass it to command line */
+		unsigned char *p;
+		decoded_query_string = strdup(query_string);
+		php_url_decode(decoded_query_string, strlen(decoded_query_string));
+		for (p = (unsigned char *) decoded_query_string; *p && *p <= ' '; p++) {
+			/* skip all leading spaces */
+		}
+		if (*p == '-') {
+			skip_getopt = 1;
+		}
+		free(decoded_query_string);
+	}
+
+	while (!skip_getopt && (c = php_getopt(argc, argv, OPTIONS, &php_optarg, &php_optind, 0)) != -1) {
 		switch (c) {
 			case 'c':
 				if (cgi_sapi_module.php_ini_path_override) {
